re`/`ComputeVecPost` 调用链中的参数传递修正，确保 `dv_workspace` 等缓冲区使用正确的分片信息。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T12:30:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T12:30:09+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177067469,"discussion_id":"4a8c5a4b17b123185da42361fb6414f2fb5ccb44","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T12:36:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T12:36:27+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177086372,"discussion_id":"f6089e5aebe39a8939f060a0a42a8cd1c3dd8981","body":"避免使用魔鬼数字16 * 16，建议定义有意义的常量","created_at":"2026-06-25T14:50:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T15:00:02+08:00","user":{"id":"67316f3b33741160e675146e","login":"guijianwei","object_id":"67316f3b33741160e675146e","name":"guijianwei","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ae/bf/a7eb56f670f3a3d16d77b3266fbd1952b5cf6aaa23e71dde6976eeb6db8d8995.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guijianwei"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848b8fdea8931fab644a1b","login":"xuchengyang","object_id":"68848b8fdea8931fab644a1b","name":"xuchengyang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuchengyang"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":630,"end_new_line":630,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177089089,"body":" 魔鬼数字主要影响了代码可读性,读者看到的数字无法理解其含义,从而难以理解程序的意图。在本例中，16可以直观的表示16对齐的含义。","created_at":"2026-06-25T15:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T15:00:02+08:00","user":{"id":"68848b8fdea8931fab644a1b","login":"xuchengyang","object_id":"68848b8fdea8931fab644a1b","name":"xuchengyang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuchengyang"}}]},{"id":177115793,"discussion_id":"e71a34208b0d077f2241b581a5353b7446c0bff1","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-25T16:25:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:25:44+08:00","user":{"id":"68e72b4a2dfaae57727b12a5","login":"yuhao_","object_id":"68e72b4a2dfaae57727b12a5","name":"yuhao_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yuhao_"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177448342,"discussion_id":"67461d49d5853c737e63acf9ab3b8294415c82fc","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-27T14:21:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T14:21:02+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","object_id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]